   UT-TIAAVV          1    4  A                                                 
   UT-IDDC            *    2  A                                                 
   UT-IDPRC           *    4  A                                                 
   UT-KDORDKL         *    1  P                                                 
   UT-IDDISTR         *    3  P 0                                               
   UT-TOTAL-LINES     *   10  P 0                                               
   UT-EFR-OP-VAL      *   10  P 2                                               
   UT-EFR-P-VAL       *   10  P 2                                               
   UT-EFR-S-VAL       *   10  P 2                                               
