FILE WXTR12D4   FB (56 0)                                                       
*     INFO SOM SKALL PRINTAS                                                    
   PR-TIAAVV          1    4  A                                                 
   PR-IDDC            *    2  A                                                 
   PR-IDPRC           *    4  A                                                 
   PR-KDORDKL         *    1  P                                                 
   PR-IDDISTR         *    3  P 0                                               
   PR-TOTAL-LINES     *    3  P 0       MASK('ZZZZ9')                           
   PR-OKS-VAL         *    5  P 2       MASK('ZZZZZZ9,99')                      
   PR-EFR-OP-VAL      *    5  P 2       MASK('ZZZZZZ9,99')                      
   PR-EFR-P-VAL       *    5  P 2       MASK('ZZZZZZ9,99')                      
   PR-NON-PACK-VAL    *    5  P 2       MASK('ZZZZZZ9,99')                      
   PR-TOTAL-VAL       *    6  P 2       MASK('ZZZZZZZZ9,99')                    
   PR-BACKLOG-LINES   *    3  P 0       MASK('ZZZZ9')                           
   PR-VKARTNTO        *    5  P 3       MASK('ZZZZZ9,999')                      
   PR-VLARTNTO        *    5  P 1       MASK('ZZZZZZZ9,9')                      
